A||N||1||red88formula||Opinions of Borla exhaust and cat converters?||||1||
Z||000000||red88formula||06-04-2001||09:41 PM||||Anyone have any?  How about any sound files?  If not Borla, whose exhaust do you like the best?  Same question as far as high flow cat...<P>Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||06-04-2001||10:34 PM||||I have the Borla and new cat in both my 87 GT 5 speed and 88 GT automatic.  The 87 sounds better, more miles on the exhaust system.. nice and mellow.  The 88's is too new and hasn't developed the mellow tones yet.<P>One benefit is that both cars run cool once the exhaust systems were put on.  I even replaced the 195 thermostat, I thought it was stuck open.<P>Its worth the money if you plan on keeping the cars.  The after market exhausts (Midas) last about a year.  The Boral should last quite a while.||||reg||1
